  "description": "An ordinary office worker who once wholeheartedly believed in picture-perfect fairy tales, Wooshin has had his romantic illusions brutally crushed. Every single man he believed to be his \"fated partner\" turned out to be complete and utter trash. Tired of the heartbreak and chaotic baggage, Wooshin finally decides to turn his back on so-called destiny, choosing instead to focus solely on achieving a quiet, stable life. Just as he resolves to protect his peace, however, someone keeps drifting into his line of sight. \n\nOnce... Twice... And then a third time...? \n\nNo matter where he goes, their paths cross with baffling regularity. Is this persistent presence simply a strange streak of bad luck, a bizarre coincidence, or could the universe truly be knocking on his door again? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
